        "id": 17312,
        "title": "Atama Operatörleri",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146656,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kendine atama oyunlar oluşturmak için güçlü bir araç olduğundan, daha hızlı kod yazmamıza yardımcı olan birkaç operatör öğrenelim.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146657,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkene, değişkenin adını yazarak <code>1</code> ekleyebileceğimizi biliyoruz. Bu durumda <code>score</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score = score + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>score</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146658,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenin adını yeniden yazmak yerine, <code>score += 1</code> ile bir sayı eklemek için <code>+=</code> operatörünü kullanabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>score</code>, ardından <code>+=</code> ve son olarak <code>1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146659,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkenin değerinden çıkarma yapmak için <code>-=</code> operatörünü kullanırız; burada <code>health</code> değerini <code>3</code> azaltıyoruz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"health -= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>-=</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146660,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkenin adından sonra yerleştirilen <strong>artırma operatörü</strong><code>++</code>, değişkenin değerini <code>1</code> artırır. Burada <code>coins++</code>, değeri <code>5</code>'ten <code>6</code>'ya çıkarır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"coins++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>coins</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>+</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146661,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buradaki <code>lives--</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi, <strong>azaltma operatörünü</strong> ( <code>--</code> ) kullanarak bir değişkenin değerinden <code>1</code> çıkarabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"lives++\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lives = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lives--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lives);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>lives--</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146662,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arrows = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"arrows += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arrows);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>8</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146663,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sayıyı bir değişkenin değerinden çıkarmak için hangi operatörü kullanırız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>-=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146664,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkenin değerine bir ekleyen operatör hangisidir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>++</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>--</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>++</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerSpeed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerSpeed--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerSpeed);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>199</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+=</code> operatörünü kullanarak değişkenin değerine on ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" xp = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"xp += \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(xp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>xp</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>-=</code> operatörünü kullanarak değişkenin değerinden 200 çıkar.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mana = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mana -= \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(mana);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-=</code>, ardından <code>200</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>ammo</code> değişkeninin değerini bir artır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ammo + 2\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ammo++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>ammo</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>+</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146669,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cephane miktarını bir azaltmak için azaltma operatörü <code>--</code> kullan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"21\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ammo--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ammo--</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
